{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169480/extras/DDS2_newgif_002.gif?t=1742377321\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">What turns a person into a drug dealer? And a drug dealer into a casino top dog? Take a crack at the high-stakes gambling world with the Drug Dealer Simulator 2: Casino DLC! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If the drug dealing underworld is not enough to satisfy your craving for money and power, now you have a chance to reach beyond! Are you ready to take your chances in a casino? And later - to take over its operation? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169480/extras/stars.png?t=1742377321\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Casino DLC introduces a brand new location and quests to Drug Dealer Simulator 2. Gain access to a VIP casino hidden away on a remote drilling rig located some distance away from the shores of Isla Sombra. Try your luck in five different gambling games: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Texas Hold'em (Multiplayer)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">All-in Poker\u00a0(Single &amp; Multiplayer)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Slot machines (Single Player)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Blackjack\u00a0(Single &amp; Multiplayer)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Roulette\u00a0(Single &amp; Multiplayer)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Caught your interest? How about owning the place and turning it into your personal piggy bank? Take on a quest that will turn you into a big-shot casino owner!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169480/extras/stars.png?t=1742377321\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">DLC FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">New location \u2013 drilling rig casino;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">5 available gambling games, including co-op poker and roulette; </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2 new quests which allow you to take over the casino.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ready? Good luck!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3169480?t=1742377321","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169480/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1742377321","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169480/b34a99ef8afe2e522a5be54610ca07d47fd0fd7e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742377321","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169480/b34a99ef8afe2e522a5be54610ca07d47fd0fd7e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742377321","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Drug Dealer Simulator 2: Casino DLC contains mentions and imagery of gambling and drug trafficking, as well as slight swearing and crude language."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169480/extras/DDS2_newgif_002.gif?t=1742377321\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">What turns a person into a drug dealer? And a drug dealer into a casino top dog? Take a crack at the high-stakes gambling world with the Drug Dealer Simulator 2: Casino DLC! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If the drug dealing underworld is not enough to satisfy your craving for money and power, now you have a chance to reach beyond! Are yo